@ seconds-left -> (draws the countdown bar and seconds into PICT in one REPL,
@ so the display never shows a half-drawn countdown)
\<< \-> left
  \<<
    PICT { #0d #40d }
    #131d #10d BLANK
    IF left 0 > THEN
      { #2d #3d } left 3 * R\->B #4d BLANK NEG REPL
    END
    left \->STR "s" + 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
    REPL
  \>>
\>>
